cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Peakly, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Peakly: a free, single-file, in-browser HPLC/FPLC chromatogram analyzer"
abstract: >-
  Peakly is a free-to-use, client-side web application for analysing
  HPLC and FPLC chromatograms. It imports common open and vendor formats,
  digitizes chromatograms from images, integrates peaks with documented and
  auditable formulas, supports calibration curves, and runs entirely in the
  browser without uploading data.
authors:
